          "message": {
            "text": "[CRITICAL/HIGH confidence] Job 'triage' runs on pull_request_target (secrets and a privileged token available) and checks out PR-head code — attacker-controlled code executes in a privileged context (pwn-request pattern). Remediation: Split the workflow: handle untrusted PR code under the unprivileged pull_request event, and keep pull_request_target jobs from checking out PR-head refs. If PR code must be processed, do it without secrets and with permissions: read-all or less."
