            "text": "[CRITICAL/HIGH confidence] Untrusted context 'github.event.pull_request.title' is interpolated directly into a run script in job 'triage'. Its value is expanded before the shell parses the line, so crafted input becomes part of the command. Remediation: Route the value through env: and reference it as a quoted shell variable, e.g. env: TITLE: ${{ <expr> }} then run: echo \"$TITLE\". The shell then receives the value as data, never as command text."
