          "message": {
            "text": "[HIGH/HIGH confidence] permissions: write-all on workflow grants the token every scope (contents, packages, actions, id-token…) — far more than any single job needs. Remediation: Add an explicit least-privilege block, e.g. permissions: { contents: read } at the workflow top level, widening only the scopes a specific job needs."
