          "message": {
            "text": "[LOW/MEDIUM confidence] actions/checkout in job 'triage' persists the repository token into .git config (the default) in a workflow reachable from PR-driven events — later steps and checked-out tooling can read it from disk. Remediation: Add 'persist-credentials: false' to the checkout step unless a later step genuinely needs the persisted token."
